From b0d1e6a0e80c835fb2d5f486f7c543edf3143158 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: noname713705 <noname713705@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 09:35:15 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Build REL_0.9 with gradle-0.8 from build files in the 0.8 DSL

The 0.9 build files are unchanged. Added, for the gradle-0.8 builder:
- settings.gradle.0.8: the projects of 0.9 without docs, with the <name>.gradle.0.8 build files
- buildSrc/settings.gradle: gradle-0.8 builds buildSrc before any settings script, from the buildSrc
  directory only; selects buildSrc/build.gradle.0.8 when the running Gradle is 0.8, any other Gradle
  keeps buildSrc/build.gradle
- build.gradle.0.8, buildSrc/build.gradle.0.8, subprojects/*/<name>.gradle.0.8: the 0.9 files translated
  to 0.8 (usePlugin, builder classpaths, version computed inline, core's external dependencies added to
  the other projects, version properties and gradle-wrapper.jar written after the compilation,
  explodedDist with ant); ide, code quality, docs, test fixtures, integration tests, zips, install,
  release left out
- Maven Central and repo.gradle.org (pmaven) instead of gradle.artifactoryonline.com;
  biz.aQute:bndlib 0.0.384 (on no repository anymore) -> 1.10.0
Source: MAVEN_CENTRAL_URL https, without trailing slash.

Run: gradle-0.8 -c settings.gradle.0.8 -Dskip.test=true -Dskip.compileTestJava=true
  -Dskip.compileTestGroovy=true -Dskip.processTestResources=true clean explodedDist

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
